Subject: Preserve developer-hosted layers and schedule their redraws

Distinguish supplied layers from AppKit backing stores, retire replaced root
contexts and present coalesced main-thread updates. Preserve the public float
opacity ABI while keeping the internal CGFloat storage unchanged.

